You're all under arrest.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:38.050
Hands in the air!

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:50.400
Who are you?

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.240
I feel faint...

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.610
Ah, Yuri!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:58.180
Officer, we were held hostage.

00:16:58.180 --> 00:16:59.450
It was so scary!

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.950
The hell?! You were the ones doing the beating!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.020
Eek! Stay away!
The hell?! You were the ones doing the beating!

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:02.380
Eek! Stay away!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:11.480
I thought it was odd that someone would
rob a hair bank, but that clarifies the motive.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:16.160
Thanks!

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.500
Keep up the good work!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.000
Th-Th-Th-Those are the culprits!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.400
I'm absolutely positive!

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:25.270
This is becoming a pain.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.580
Never mind that, what are we
going to do about Malatesta?

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:31.210
No worries there.
I put a transmitter on her earlier.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.270
That's my partner for you!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.060
Worthless idiots.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.150
We'll just have to do it ourselves.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.690
Looks that way.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:58.740
Target is in Block P headed towards No. 6!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:17:59.470
Roger!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:20.890
Keep going straight!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:31.670
A little further!

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:47.750
There!

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.640
Hey, you guys! That road isn't attached yet!

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.570
Balance yourselves out or you'll fall!

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:08.780
Back up!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.200
Back up at full speed!

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.390
L-Lan... and Jerry?!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:26.050
It seems you've taken an
interest in the muscle fortifier.

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:28.260
Could be.

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.400
The drug isn't finished yet!

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:30.500
Help me!
The drug isn't finished yet!

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:31.070
Help me!

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:34.170
It's a shot in the dark,
but if it works, it'll be very valuable.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:37.510
Isn't Malatesta the lynchpin
of your brother's research?

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:39.030
Why would you do this to your own...

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:42.340
We couldn't care less about his research.

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.780
It'll be worth a lot more money if we use it!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.580
Hand it over!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.380
Hey, hey! Third from the right!

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:52.510
Watch where you're going or that
other police car is going to hit you!

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:57.090
Move forward three meters!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:01.360
Gently press on the gas,
like you're playing footies with Ma!

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.620
Stop, stop!

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:09.640
Grip the wheel firmly
and keep your elbows relaxed.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:14.170
Ideally, you should keep them
parallel in a horizontal position.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.710
Ah! Now forward, forward, forward!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.990
Come on, come on, come on!
Keep your eyes peeled!

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:35.990
Limit your blinking to
two blinks every ten seconds!

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.130
How dare you betray your fans!

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.160
Like we care!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:44.640
Way to go, Kei!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.200
Catch!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.940
Back up, back up!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.900
Get back here!

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:26.170
Go forward, forward!

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:32.320
Idiots!

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:36.310
Go ahead, keep messing it up,
see if I care! I'm going to eat my lunch.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:39.680
Hey, you're gonna spill my tea!
Knock it off already!

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:42.160
What?!

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:43.460
The wrong cat?!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.960
Yes. The real Malatesta
is a female. This is a male.

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:48.460
See for yourself.

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:49.830
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:56.340
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.340 --> 00:23:02.840
I passed through a distant, silvery time tunnel
Giniro haruka na taimu tonneru nukete

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:09.440
And met a wanderer with unclouded eyes
Deatta sunda me no samayoibito

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.890
Space Fantasy

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:16.220
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:18.360
Space Fantasy

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:22.300
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:28.770
Even if you were from another planet,
Tatoeba anata ga betsu no hoshi no hito demo

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:35.000
It wouldn't matter to me, because I've fallen in love
Watashi wa kamawanai aishita nara

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:39.010
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:41.750
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:48.150
Love is zero G...
Koi wa mujuuryoku...

00:24:02.140 --> 00:24:03.770
No, get it right!

00:24:03.770 --> 00:24:05.570
How about just "Criados"?

00:24:07.910 --> 00:24:09.410
That isn't right...

00:24:09.410 --> 00:24:11.380
Try "heartbeat."

00:24:14.380 --> 00:24:17.120
Give it a rest already.
You know it's impossible.

00:24:17.120 --> 00:24:18.420
You say it, then.

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:19.790
Yeah, sure.

00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:22.490
Next episode is "Criados' Heartbeat"!

